because SoundEvent needs access to this function, SoundEvent is declared as a friend
of AudioSystem.
Listing 7.5 gives the declaration of SoundEvent. Most notably, its member data includes a
pointer to the AudioSystem and the ID. Note that while the default constructor is public, the
